      "title": "PG.1",
      "markdown": "Untitled\n\n## Page pg1\n\nHow long have you been at New Home?\n\nI’ve been at New Home for thirteen years.\n\nWhat’s your favorite thing about teaching?\n\nBuilding realtionships with my students and co-workers.\n\nWhen do you feel the most accomplished?\n\nWhen I’ve had a really good day of teaching and having life conversations with my students.\n\nWhy did you decide to teach at New Home?\n\nWe wanted a small school for our kids. My son got put into Pre-K here, and we’ve never looked back. We love the small town feel of New Home.\n\nWhat’s a lesson your family has taught you?\n\nThey’ve taught me unconditional love. They’ve shown me how to love, forgive, and have grace. I can see the love of God in how much I love my kids.\n",
